Issue: JSON parsing errors

Solution: Verify JSON files are properly formatted
Run: jq . data/users.json to validate JSON syntax
Issue: Permission denied errors

Solution: Check script permissions
Run: chmod +x scripts/iam_risk_analyzer.py
Issue: No output in report

Solution: Check if reports directory exists
Run: mkdir -p reports
